          "bbox": [
            141,
            822,
            535,
            880
          ],
          "confidence": 98.52
        },
        {
          "text": "叩首重霄，捫心萬里。",
          "bbox": [
            290,
            946,
            957,
            1009
          ],
          "confidence": 99.72
        },
        {
          "text": "欽惟大皇帝陛下：",
